     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Aspect in the past",
     "texto": [
      "**Zwiedzaliśmy miasto** presents an activity in progress or repeated: «we were visiting the city».",
      "**Odwiedziliśmy muzeum** presents a completed visit: «we visited the museum»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two forms of the past",
     "texto": [
      "**Zwiedzać** is imperfective and **zwiedzić** is perfective.",
      "Polish can use two different verbs where English usually uses the same past form."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
